# Accessibility audit: Sidebar (2026-11-16)

Scope: `spec/components/sidebar/contract.json` and `contract.md`, `src/components/sidebar/*`, `src/controllers/labelled-by.ts` (SidebarGroup's label now goes through `LabelledByController`), `playwright/tests/sidebar/*`. Standard: WCAG 2.2 AA and the WAI-ARIA APG patterns the contract names (landmarks, disclosure for the trigger, modal dialog for the drawer). Method: behavior spec, `check`, and live probes in Chromium against the running Storybook (real key presses, CDP `Accessibility.getFullAXTree`, computed styles, media emulation).

